---
source: crates/daemon/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
List, find, keep or resolve commitments: promises made in mail

Usage: mxr commitments [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  resolve  Mark a commitment resolved by id
  add      Keep a promise from a message you sent, due at a time, so it comes back when due. Adding it again moves the date
  detect   Find promises you made in a message you sent, with their due times
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --contact <CONTACT>
      --status <STATUS>    [possible values: open, resolved, expired]
      --account <ACCOUNT>
      --format <FORMAT>    [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help               Print help
